        "description": "Removes a contingent value from a field group.",
        "id.descr": "<xdoc><p>The unique contingent value ID.</p><p>To view the contingent value ID in the <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Contingent Values</span> view, click the <span class=\"esri_uicontrol\">Toggle Value IDs</span> button on the ribbon. In Python, this value can be accessed using the arcpy.da.ListContingentValues function.</p></xdoc>",
        "id.title": "Contingent Value ID",
